Relevance to KarigarSetu

The size and diversity of India's handicraft sector highlight the need for better connections between artisans, clusters, and customers. With millions of artisans working across hundreds of craft categories and geographically distributed clusters, digital platforms can help improve product discovery and market access.

KarigarSetu is designed around this opportunity by providing features such as artisan clusters, Shop by Region, product customisation, price history, voice-based interaction, and AI-assisted product discovery. The platform aims to make traditional crafts easier to discover while helping artisans reach customers beyond their immediate local markets.

The planned Shop by Region feature is particularly aligned with India's geographically diverse handicraft ecosystem, allowing customers to select a state and discover traditional crafts associated with that region.

